<ui_settings>
    <version>2.9</version>
    <model_locked>False</model_locked>
    <canvas_bg_color>#ffffff</canvas_bg_color>
    <initialization_code><![CDATA[# NOTE: Variables and functions defined here will be
# available for use in all Macro and Expression scripts.
# NOTE: This code is always executed prior to simulation start.

# The variable 'SETTINGS_DIR' holds the directory where the loaded Panel .cus file is located.
# Also you can call the 'get_settings_dir_path()' function in any
# Macro and Expression script to get the same directory.
SETTINGS_DIR = get_settings_dir_path()

# The 'add_to_python_path(folder)' function can be used to add a custom folder
# with Python files and packages to the PYTHONPATH. After a folder is added, all Python
# files and Python packages from it can be imported into the SCADA Namespace.

# HIL API is imported as 'hil'
# SCADA API is imported as 'panel'
# SCADA API constants are imported as 'api_const'
# Numpy module is imported as 'np'
# Scipy module is imported as 'sp'
# Schematic Editor model namespace is imported as 'scm'
# Function for printing to the HIL SCADA Message log is imported as 'printf'.


# grid source state, shared by the grid sliders
GRID = {'v': 1.0, 'f': 50.0, 'h5': 0.0, 'h7': 0.0}
V_PH = 230.940108
def apply_grid():
    hil.set_source_sine_waveform('Vgrid', rms=GRID['v'] * V_PH, frequency=GRID['f'],
                                 harmonics_pu=[(5, GRID['h5'] / 100.0, 0.0), (7, GRID['h7'] / 100.0, 0.0)])
# analog outputs for the oscilloscope (hil_bench/analog_out.py)
hil.set_analog_output(1, 'Va', scaling=50.0, offset=0.0)   # PCC voltage, phase a: 50 V/V -> 326 V peak = 6.5 V, 14 % THD still < 8 V
hil.set_analog_output(2, 'Ia', scaling=25.0, offset=0.0)   # grid current, phase a: 25 A/V -> 204 A peak = 8.2 V
hil.set_analog_output(3, 'iref_a', scaling=25.0, offset=0.0)   # reference current, phase a, same scale as channel 2: overlay them
hil.set_analog_output(4, 'err_a', scaling=1.0, offset=0.0)   # tracking error iref - i (alpha axis): 1 A/V, magnified 25 x against ch 2
]]></initialization_code>
    <components>
        <component_data>
                <id>ac47bb0dbb5149a3bde23ef281f3859f</id>
                <name><![CDATA[About]]></name>
                <type>TextNote</type>
                <description><![CDATA[]]></description>
                <text><![CDATA[PV INVERTER EMISSION BENCH  (100 kVA, 400 V, 750 V DC, 10 kHz, LCL; PR current control)
Each order slider = fraction of its IEEE 1547 limit, referred to RATED current (not to the fundamental).
Bars: PCC voltage per order in %% of nominal, and grid current per order in %% of rated.
Meter = 10-cycle DFT of phase a, updated every 0.2 s. After a change, allow ~2 s to settle (slowest mode about 0.5 s on SCR 5).]]></text>
                <widget_settings>
